WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
If you take blood pressure or other heart medications, this one is important.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.020
If you normally take your blood pressure medication in the morning, please take

3
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:07.620
it with a small

4
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.120
sip of water.

5
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.580
However, please confirm this with your doctor's office in advance, as

6
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:13.640
recommendations can

7
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.000
vary depending on your specific medication.

8
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.640
Do not skip your blood pressure medication without checking with us first.

9
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.940
Keeping your blood pressure stable during the procedure is important for your

10
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:24.440
safety, and

11
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.240
your doctor wants to make sure you're set up well before you arrive.
